// The Gilded Vale's own fish (1.4; docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-08-vale-fish-design.md),
// and the game's own river and lake fish in the Vale's water.
//
// Ids are blinxxy.MuseArt.Vale_<Name>: not the mod's own blinxxy.MuseArt_ prefix, which the
// painting record leaves out (RecordTabs), so a still life of one fills its Fish-tab entry;
// and not the dev pack's {{ModId}}, so the ids survive the move into the released pack.
//
// Where they bite (the location's Fish, below):
//   River (the fallback area: all water outside the lake): the Forest's river fish, the Loach.
//   Lake (x 48-84, y 55-71): the Mountain lake's fish, the Shiner and the Gilt Carp.
//   The Cascade Trout bites only in the two cascade pools, and the Falls Sculpin only in the
//   waterfall basin, by bobber position inside the River area.
//   The basin isn't built yet (session vale-map-gaps, branch claude/infallible-jang-a66ee9):
//   its rectangle is the top of the river for now. Re-check it, and the lake's east edge (the
//   overlook bluff), once that branch is merged.
